supralinux-desktop (0.1.0~dev2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Expand the Aurora candidate baseline with screen-locker and SDDM KCMs.
  * Add GTK/Breeze integration for non-Qt desktop applications.
  * Add printing with Print Manager and the CUPS stack.
  * Add Samba sharing integration and KIO extras.
  * Add OpenVPN and OpenConnect NetworkManager backends.
  * Add accessibility runtime pieces (AT-SPI, Orca, Speech Dispatcher).
  * Add Plasma SMART disk-health integration.
  * Keep Discover out of the hard dependency set until Snap recommendations are
    neutralized by the SupraLINUX Snap policy package.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <noreply@supralinux.com>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:18:00 -0300

supralinux-desktop (0.1.0~dev1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial development metapackage for the SupraLINUX Aurora Plasma baseline.
  * Start from Ubuntu 26.04 LTS packages without depending on kubuntu-desktop.
  * Declare the first audited core/integration dependency set for clean-VM testing.

